#: ../../language/error_codes/E4049.md:1
msgid "E4049"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4049.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `pkg_magic_mismatch`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4049.md:5
msgid "Magic number mismatch for the package file."
msgstr "包文件的魔法数字不匹配。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4049.md:7
msgid ""
"This means your local build files are corrupted or outdated. First try "
"update/reinstall your MoonBit installation as in our [Download "
"Page](https://www.moonbitlang.com/download/). Then run `moon clean` and "
"build again. If the error persists, please submit a bug report here:"
msgstr ""
"这意味着构建文件已损坏或过时。请先按照[下载页面](https://www.moonbitlang.cn/download/)的说明更新或重新安装 "
"MoonBit，再运行 `moon clean` 并重新构建。如果错误仍然存在，请在此提交错误报告："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4049.md:13
msgid "<https://github.com/moonbitlang/moonbit-docs/issues/new?labels=bug,ICE>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4049.md:15
msgid ""
"This package-loading diagnostic has no checked source example because "
"producing it depends on stale or incompatible internal build artifacts "
"rather than ordinary source code."
msgstr "此包加载诊断没有受检查的源码示例，因为触发它依赖过时或不兼容的内部构建产物，而不是普通源码。"
